; [move-elements-to-editor] The button faces used to be four StyleBoxFlats built
; in _apply_parchment_styles(). They are overrides on this node now, so the
; card's face colour, its rim and its corner radius are all inspector work. Local
; overrides on purpose: ONLY these three cards get this face, every other Button
; in the game keeps the global theme.
;
; [slot ui phase 3] Parchment is gone: the faces are plum, and the gold-vine
; nine-patch (Vines, the item card's own card_frame.png) is the rim. Every child
; below sits inside the vines' 30 px band.

